📊 Verdict

Your codebase is feature-complete for an MVP demo — but it has a dev store data corruption bug (#3 in critical bugs) that WILL lose data in production. The duplicate records bug (#2) makes any DB reconnect break the UI. The hardcoded demo credentials (#9) and infinite JWT tokens (#7) are security issues that prevent production deployment.

Cost to fix everything above: ~2-3 days of focused work. The structural dev-store issues are the hardest; the rest are quick.   